        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204-a1">

                <pb facs="0403" n="1363" xml:id="pg1363"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 275.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Sir H. Drummond Wolff
                        to Mr. Pratt.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Pratt</hi>: I have thought you would like
                    to have a copy of a telegram received yesterday from Her Majesty’s
                    consul-general at Tabriz.</p>
                <p>I communicated its contents to the Emin é Soultan and to the embassy at
                    Constantinople.</p>
                <p>Yours, very sincerely,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Drummond
                    Wolff.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
